@steven-wu/dsh-cost-meter README · @steven-wu/dsh-cost-meter：Out-of-tree [dsh](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) plugin that
shows a live **USD cost badge** for the open conversation in the Web UI.

It is a dual-face `dsh.client` package:

@steven-wu/dsh-cost-meter README · Pricing table：Pricing is USD per **million** tokens, keyed by `provider/model`:

```jsonc
{
  "per": 1000000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "default": { "input": 0.6525, "output": 1.9575, "cacheRead": 0.02175, "cacheWrite": 0 },

@steven-wu/dsh-cost-meter README · restart the web profile, then refresh the page：The `sessionCost` projection is delivered through the same seam as
`tokenUsage` / `sessionStats`, so it also appears in every projection carrier
(history tail page, `session/projection` push frames) without extra wiring.
